summary: KS-TC:ssd/test_devs_setup
description: test devs setup for nvme ssd testing
contact: Yi Zhang <yizhan@redhat.com>
component:
  - kernel
path: /storage/ssd/test_devs_setup
test: bash -x ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
recommend:
  - beakerlib-redhat
duration: 30m
